                                "sense_id": "868b726e-1260-3637-a8cc-b761b5f4bf75",
                                "text": "To achieve the correct riding contact required by the precision of the sport of riding, there is no substitute for pure vegetably tanned leather - which I choose to name \"naturally tanned\" because no synthetic materials are used in their tanning […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d31cf0a-b75e-4027-99b1-ba6d2509aafd",
